WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.800
I think Amber's been pretty clear about how she feels.

2
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.860
I'm nothing like my dad. I want to be just like you.

3
00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.280
I've fought to keep this planet safe.

4
00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.000
Your powers have got to be due any day now, son.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Morning!

6
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
I'm scared, Dad. What if I can't do this?

7
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Follow me.

8
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Go down. Land. I said land.

9
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Stop!

10
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Get up.

11
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.000
I'm actually getting used to this a little.

12
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.000
That's not good.

13
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
You need to be better.

14
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
After everything he's done, how can I live up to all that?

15
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
You need to decide what kind of hero you want to be.

16
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.000
That was you in the blue and the yellow?

17
00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.960
May we count on you in the future?

18
00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.520
Yeah, I think so.

19
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:30.000
[Music]

20
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Son, we need to talk. What I'm about to tell you will change everything.

21
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Dad.

22
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.000
I wasn't ready before. Now I am.

23
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.000
You being a superhero is the coolest thing that's ever happened to me.

24
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Now take me flying or I'm gonna tell everyone you're Invincible.
